    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0 Super Evolution with Enhanced Anime Visuals</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No prior experience required\u2014enjoy this title to the fullest, even if you're new to the series!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385360/extras/54d701f89a667567db63c00529adff8a.avif?t=1740733490\" width=600 height=263 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0 High-Speed Action Meets New Simulation Mode</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash through vast, stunning landscapes on your bike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect costumes and special items for enhanced gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action sequences are designed for gamepads (optimized for Xbox controllers, with vibration support).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385360/extras/56b672c8f9dda3db09d794a20804f5fe.avif?t=1740733490\" width=600 height=263 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0 New Simulation Mode</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added a male protagonist mode, &quot;B Mode&quot;!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the Valkyries\u2019 private quarters aboard the mothership and indulge in playful mischief.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385360/extras/9d9739f71ea0b14c01e8fd6f7e5303ca.avif?t=1740733490\" width=600 height=263 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0 Expanded Defeat Events and Mischief Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-quality defeat events for an immersive experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playful massage events now included!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock mischievous events within the B game mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0 Powerful Skills and Gear for All Skill Levels</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience seamless transitions with your bike, quick warps, and evasive maneuvers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use points to activate defensive shields, unleash powerful converging lasers, or protect yourself from bullets and explosions, offering casual action enjoyment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The better you get, the more stylish your combat becomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simply riding your bike across on-road and off-road terrain is thrilling and earns points effortlessly.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0 Super Evolution with Enhanced Anime Visuals</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No prior experience required\u2014enjoy this title to the fullest, even if you're new to the series!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385360/extras/54d701f89a667567db63c00529adff8a.avif?t=1740733490\" width=600 height=263 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0 High-Speed Action Meets New Simulation Mode</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash through vast, stunning landscapes on your bike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect costumes and special items for enhanced gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action sequences are designed for gamepads (optimized for Xbox controllers, with vibration support).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385360/extras/56b672c8f9dda3db09d794a20804f5fe.avif?t=1740733490\" width=600 height=263 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0 New Simulation Mode</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added a male protagonist mode, &quot;B Mode&quot;!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the Valkyries\u2019 private quarters aboard the mothership and indulge in playful mischief.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385360/extras/9d9739f71ea0b14c01e8fd6f7e5303ca.avif?t=1740733490\" width=600 height=263 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0 Expanded Defeat Events and Mischief Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-quality defeat events for an immersive experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playful massage events now included!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock mischievous events within the B game mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0 Powerful Skills and Gear for All Skill Levels</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience seamless transitions with your bike, quick warps, and evasive maneuvers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use points to activate defensive shields, unleash powerful converging lasers, or protect yourself from bullets and explosions, offering casual action enjoyment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The better you get, the more stylish your combat becomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simply riding your bike across on-road and off-road terrain is thrilling and earns points effortlessly.</p></li></ul>",
